SUMMARY:Interchange Message: OVAL STATION: Until mid December\, Oval 
 station will operate with an 'up' escalator service only\, while planned 
 maintenance takes place on one escalator. Please take care when using the 
 spiral staircase\, which has 80 steps. Alternatively\, use local buses to 
 nearby stations. Stockwell: Bus 155\, from stop R on Kennington Park 
 Road\, Vauxhall: Bus 36 185 or 436\, from stop D on Harleyford Street
END:VEVENT
